---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | JiApps Organization"
  description="JiApps Terms of Service governing the use of proprietary software products and custom IT engineering services."
>
  <main id="main" class="flex-grow">
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-14 md:pt-20 pb-16">
      <div class="sticker mb-6 rotate-0">Legal Agreement</div>
      <h1 class="h-page mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-light text-base mb-8">
        Last updated: October 2026 &bull; Applicable to JiApps Software Products and IT Client Engagements.
      </p>

      <div class="card p-8 md:p-12 space-y-8 bg-white text-ink leading-relaxed text-base">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using the website (jiapp.online), purchasing software licenses (such as BillZ POS), or entering into a Master Services Agreement (MSA) or Statement of Work (SOW) with JiApps Organization, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">2. Software Licensing (BillZ &amp; Accounts)</h2>
          <p>
            For customers utilizing our retail software:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-ink-light">
            <li><strong>License Grant:</strong> Upon purchase, JiApps grants you a non-exclusive, revocable, non-transferable license to execute the software on authorized business hardware.</li>
            <li><strong>Offline Functionality:</strong> Software marked as offline-first executes locally. You are responsible for maintaining local machine backups unless enrolled in JiApps Cloud Sync.</li>
            <li><strong>Restrictions:</strong> Reverse engineering, decompiling, or attempting to bypass license verification algorithms is strictly prohibited.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">3. IT Services &amp; Custom Development Contracts</h2>
          <p>
            For organizations hiring JiApps for software, web, or mobile app development:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-ink-light">
            <li><strong>Statement of Work (SOW):</strong> Project deliverables, timelines, milestones, and payment terms are formally documented in an executed SOW.</li>
            <li><strong>Intellectual Property Transfer:</strong> Full ownership of custom code, designs, and deliverables transfers completely to the client upon full payment of the agreed milestones.</li>
            <li><strong>Warranty Period:</strong> JiApps provides a complimentary 30-day post-launch warranty covering bug fixes and stabilization for deliverable scopes.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">4. Payment Terms &amp; Invoicing</h2>
          <p>
            Payment terms for services are specified in the individual contract or invoice (e.g. Net 15 or milestone-based disbursements). Software subscriptions and one-time retail licenses are billed according to published rates on our pricing page.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, JiApps and its directors, engineers, or affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from local hardware malfunction, loss of data caused by hardware defects, or unauthorized third-party network access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">6. Inquiries and Legal Notices</h2>
          <p>
            For all formal notices, contractual queries, or dispute resolution, contact:
          </p>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 border-2 border-line">
            <p class="font-bold text-ink">JiApps Organization &bull; Corporate Counsel</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">Official Email: <a href="mailto:hello@jiapp.online" class="font-mono font-bold text-brand-600 underline">hello@jiapp.online</a></p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-light">Website: <a href="https://jiapp.online" class="underline">https://jiapp.online</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
